<title>THAILAND: Thai markets to close April 14-15 for holidays.</title>
<headline>Thai markets to close April 14-15 for holidays.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thailand's stock market, banks and finance firms will be closed from April 14-15 for the traditional Thai New Year holidays, a Stock Exchange of Thailand (SET) official said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The markets will reopen on April 16, she told Reuters.</p>
<p>The government said its offices would be closed from April 14-16.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
</text>
